{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04258","headline":"夏日夜忆张二 · 骆宾王","name":"夏日夜忆张二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏枕忧思深，拥膝独长吟。\n烹鲤无尺素，筌鱼劳寸心。\n疎麻空有折，芳桂湛无斟。\n广庭含夕气，闲宇澹虚阴。\n织虫垂夜砌，惊鸟栖暝林。\n驩娱百年促，羁病一生侵。\n讵堪孤月夜，流水入鸣琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}